; ⚠️ § CHECKLIST 1.11 — LICENCE COMPLIANCE, NOT POLISH. Three CC-BY-4.0 models
; ship (CROCS, PANTULOG, IKE — Art_Direction.md §4b) and the one thing their
; licence requires is that the author be reachable from somewhere the game
; actually ships. Bottom-right corner, out of the pennant column entirely,
; because there is no fifth pennant artwork and this button is not trying to
; look like one — see credits_panel.gd's own header for the rest of the
; reasoning.
; ⚠️ offset_bottom -40 CLIPPED IN REAL FULLSCREEN, 🧑 2026-08-01: *"credits not
; seen much in full screen raise it a bit"*. Same class of bug MatchSetup.tscn
; already documents on its own BackButton — a control this close to the true
; bottom edge is inside the OS taskbar/safe-area strip on a real monitor even
; though it previews fine in the editor's own viewport. Matched to that fix's
; clearance (96px) rather than picked by eye.
